    "n": 9,
    "title": "Function Calling & Tool Use",
    "blurb": "LLMs cannot do anything. They generate text. That is the entire capability. They cannot check the weather, query a database, send an email, run code, or read a file. Every \"AI agent\" you have ever seen is an LLM generating JSON that says which function to call -- and then your code actually calling it. The model is the brain. Tools are the hands. Function calling is the nervous system connecting them.",
